, "originalText": "Mesures desktop", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 57089522, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904876558, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 519998076, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pc-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 81504, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 340, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1O5", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Fond Blue 600 et deux motifs de cercles (bg-pattern-top.svg en haut \u00e0\ngauche, bg-pattern-bottom.svg en bas \u00e0 droite, 978 \u00d7 978 chacun) :\npositions cal\u00e9es en Phase 3.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 350 \u00d7 374 centr\u00e9e (x 545, y 173), rayon \u2248 15, blanche, grande\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ombre douce.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Haut de la carte : bg-pattern-card.svg 350 \u00d7 140.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo ronde 96 px (fichier 96 \u00d7 96) + bordure blanche 5 px (106),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0centr\u00e9e sur le bas du motif (y 313).\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Victor Crest \u00bb 18 px 700 Navy 950 + \u00ab 26 \u00bb 18 px 400 Gray 500,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0encre \u00e0 23 sous la photo ; \u00ab London \u00bb 14 px 400 Gray 500, 16 dessous.\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Trait 1 px Gray 100 sur toute la largeur (y 458).\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Statistiques : chiffres 18 px 700 Navy 950, libell\u00e9s \u2248 10 px\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Gray 500 espac\u00e9s ; 3 colonnes (centres x 622, 720, 819) ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0encre \u00e0 29 sous le trait, 27 en bas.\n\nTailles cal\u00e9es : nom 18 (1 %) \u00b7 ville 14 (0 %) \u00b7 chiffres 18 (\u2264 3 %).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1139877924, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Fond Blue 600 et deux motifs de cercles (bg-pattern-top.svg en haut \u00e0\ngauche, bg-pattern-bottom.svg en bas \u00e0 droite, 978 \u00d7 978 chacun) :\npositions cal\u00e9es en Phase 3.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 350 \u00d7 374 centr\u00e9e (x 545, y 173), rayon \u2248 15, blanche, grande\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ombre douce.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Haut de la carte : bg-pattern-card.svg 350 \u00d7 140.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo ronde 96 px (fichier 96 \u00d7 96) + bordure blanche 5 px (106),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0centr\u00e9e sur le bas du motif (y 313).\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Victor Crest \u00bb 18 px 700 Navy 950 + \u00ab 26 \u00bb 18 px 400 Gray 500,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0encre \u00e0 23 sous la photo ; \u00ab London \u00bb 14 px 400 Gray 500, 16 dessous.\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Trait 1 px Gray 100 sur toute la largeur (y 458).\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Statistiques : chiffres 18 px 700 Navy 950, libell\u00e9s \u2248 10 px\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Gray 500 espac\u00e9s ; 3 colonnes (centres x 622, 720, 819) ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0encre \u00e0 29 sous le trait, 27 en bas.\n\nTailles cal\u00e9es : nom 18 (1 %) \u00b7 ville 14 (0 %) \u00b7 chiffres 18 (\u2264 3 %).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904876558, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1149875904, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pc-1b-t", "type": "text", "x": 80000, "y": 1000, "width": 374, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1O6", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 667 (mobile.jpg)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1088166685, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1B \u