0 px\nau plus ; en dessous de 398 px, \u00e0 24 px des bords.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1330985869, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 327 \u00d7 374 (x 24, y 147) : 24 px des bords, m\u00eame hauteur.\n2-5 M\u00eames tailles de texte et m\u00eames \u00e9carts verticaux qu'en desktop ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0statistiques resserr\u00e9es (centres x 96, 187, 277).\n\nProposition (Q-B4) : la m\u00eame carte \u00e0 toutes les largeurs, 350 px\nau plus ; en dessous de 398 px, \u00e0 24 px des bords.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904876558, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1252829787, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pc-1c-t", "type": "text", "x": 81480, "y": 1120, "width": 319, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1OH", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1C \u00b7 Arbre HTML (proposition)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159395500, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1C \u00b7 Arbre HTML (proposition)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904876558, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 977999796, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pc-1c-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 81480, "y": 1160, "width": 1000, "height": 300, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1OI", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1808088273, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793904876558, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1240438901}, {"id": "pc-1c-b", "type": "text", "x": 81504, "y": 1184, "width": 95